robot.js in this directory holds meshes and colours adapted from RoboLab v0.3.1
(https://github.com/NVlabs/RoboLab, commit 9db0aaf09d9fe5d4f37b168320788258c7012463),
assets/robots/franka_robotiq_2f_85_flattened.usd.

Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. All rights reserved.

Changes made by AMP: each link's meshes were grouped by material colour and simplified to 12% of
their triangles (19% for the gripper; parts under 300 triangles kept whole), and the gripper
adapter's cylinder was kept as its size, for the project page.

